ame":"Igor Zakharkin","role":"Amirkhanov"},{"id":1118248,"name":"Pavel Belozerov","role":"Boich","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jWP0mNcb1kOd7RMnsje4hX0j2zB.jpg"},{"id":2538533,"name":"Irina Ziborova","role":"Maya Borisovna","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kPaDa8SAZFTOvoPidlX9e1ItYwr.jpg"},{"id":2220380,"name":"Yelena Charkviani","role":"Tamara Mikhailovna","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mYBtbbqMdutU8o7HnIqUjttwBSd.jpg"},{"id":2538537,"name":"Pavel Parkhomenko","role":"Kirill"},{"id":2538538,"name":"Mariya Felyanina","role":"Investigator"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"La ballerina del Bolshoi","overview":"Yulka è una giovane ballerina russa incredibilmente talentuosa. Può diventare una grande ballerina che lotta per il suo posto al Bolshoi di Mosca. Ma per perseguire questo scopo deve rinunciare a tutto: gli interessi della famiglia, il suo primo amore, l'amicizia. Più volte dovrà affrontare una scelta complessa tra il sogno della bellezza e la vita reale."},{"language":"en-US","title":"The Bolshoi","overview":"Young and extremely talented dancer Yulya Olshanskaya from a small mining town draws a “happy ticket”: she is noticed by a former ballet dancer Pototsky and he promises her a future of great ballerina, worthy of the main stage of the country. However, in order to become a diamond, anyone, even the most outstanding brilliant, needs to be cut, and the way to the legendary stage of The Bolshoi Theatre for Yulya lies through the walls of the ballet school, where the more capricious teacher Galina Mikhailovna Beletskaya takes custody of the rebellious provincial.  Turning into a prima will require incredible self-denial, and Yulya herself will have to make sure that the big ballet is not only the whiteness of the packs, the gold of the boxes and the slip of silk ribbons. But no obstacles will stop the one who has the big dream."},{"language":"ru-RU","overview":"Юная и необычайно талантливая танцовщица Юля Ольшанская из маленького шахтерского городка вытягивает «счастливый билет»: её замечает бывший артист балета Потоцкий и прочит будущее великой балерины, достойной главной сцены страны. Однако для того, чтобы стать бриллиантом, любому, даже самому выдающемуся алмазу, требуется огранка, и путь на легендарные подмостки Большого театра для Юли лежит через стены балетной школы, где опеку над непокорной провинциалкой берет еще более своенравная преподавательница Галина Михайловна Белецкая. Превращение в приму потребует невероятного самоотречения, и Юля на собственном опыте должна будет убедиться, что большой балет — это не только белизна пачек, золото лож и скольжение шелковых лент. Но никакие препятствия не остановят того, у кого есть Большая Мечта."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hBz18GpUsYqm14NznpbqX2D8WF7.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/m3UY4N3nc4PSRDhKagxnYXAkNEa.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":437941,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"ru-RU","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hBz18GpUsYqm14NznpbqX2D8WF7.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hBz18GpUsYqm14NznpbqX2D8WF7.jpg","language":"it","width":500,"height":750},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hBz18GpUsYqm14NznpbqX2D8WF7.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hBz18GpUsYqm14NznpbqX2D8WF7.jpg","language":"it","width":500,"height":750}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/osnDjnyC0VehQS5ao8AeYKcl1Ou.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/osnDjnyC0VehQS5ao8AeYKcl1Ou.jpg","language":"en","width":1200,"height":1600},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/ori